    "body": "Seems that Firefox supports it (see https://searchfox.org/mozilla-central/source/dom/html/nsHTMLDocument.cpp#1181) but that it doesn't work properly (see this legacy bug https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=264403). Though given the list of open `document.open` [Bugzilla issues](https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/buglist.cgi?quicksearch=document.open), it seems there's always been at least some problems with it.\r\n\r\n### Edit:\r\n\r\nI can check Safari later today. What about Edge?",
